<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <!-- Hardened-runtime exceptions portal actually needs. None today:
         native Swift plus statically linked Rust, no JIT, no unsigned memory,
         and no library-validation exceptions. The application, CLI, daemon,
         and prompt are modes of the same signed bundle executable. LAContext,
         security-framework Keychain calls, and the current SecAccessControl
         item binding require no additional hardened-runtime exception. -->
</dict>
</plist>
